            "max": 1200,
            "min": 1,
            "max_items": null,
            "multiline": true,
            "value": "Read who the department is against Identity's standard, and say whether it is enough to start work on. The standard has five points, and only five:\ngoal: the goal names what the department makes and for whom.\nitems: done-when is a list of items, and each item says how it is checked.\nrules: every rule is tagged go, ask, refuse or always.\nowner, budget: the department has an owner and a budget.\ninvented: nothing is invented; a fact the owner did not give is marked to confirm, never stated.",
            "as_shipped": true,
            "waits": null
          }
        ]
      }
