            "value": "Recognise what kind of words the owner has given. There are five kinds, and only five:\ntask: \"do X for me\". query: \"tell me Y\". directive: \"from now on, do Z\", a standing change to how the department works or to its goal. feedback: \"that was wrong\", about work already made. new-idea: \"I want a new capability\", something the department cannot do today.",
