            "multiline": true,
            "value": "go: do it. ask: it reaches outside what the department makes (money, a message to someone, a change to the goal), so the owner stamps first. refuse: it breaks a rule. Reading the web is not outside: the department can read any page.\nunsure: facts the request says the owner is not sure of, in a few words each; [] when none.\nrule: a standing rule the request states (always or never, from now on) with its tag; null when it is one piece of work.",
